### Questions git asks for a password or passphrase.

## What can go wrong in starting the askpass server, the program git asks
## for passwords through.

# Which input was refused, on a system without the askpass server.
askpass-what = askpass
askpass-unavailable = not available on this system yet
# The steps that can fail; each is followed by what failed.
askpass-reading-random = reading random bytes
askpass-starting-thread = starting the askpass thread
askpass-creating-directory = creating a private directory for the askpass socket
askpass-no-directory = no usable directory
askpass-binding-socket = binding the askpass socket
askpass-preparing-socket = preparing the askpass socket
askpass-not-local = the askpass server is not on a port of this machine
askpass-listening = listening for the askpass program
askpass-preparing-port = preparing the askpass port
